    <task id="LOCAL‎-00007" summary="- Added clear tooltips to all reasoning action buttons (Expand, Critique, Refine, Select, Pin)&#10;- Introduced a visual action bar to distinguish AI reasoning actions from text editing&#10;- Fixed state reset issues caused by reruns (preserving editor content on Pin actions)&#10;- Corrected misuse of child-related variables in critique handling&#10;- Improved parsing of LLM outputs to prevent splitting titles and explanations into separate nodes&#10;- Refined button key usage to avoid collisions and unstable UI behavior&#10;- Enhanced visual hierarchy (logo sizing, spacing, and emphasis)&#10;- Strengthened conceptual separation between committing to a path (Select) and preserving alternatives (Pin)">
